+/*!
+ * ARM64 in-place 16-bit word permutation of one half of a vector register
+ * (VPSHUFLW/VPSHUFHW): word (base + i) of `reg` becomes word
+ * (base + ((imm >> (2*i)) & 3)) of the original value, for i in 0..3.
+ * Uses the reserved X16/X17 scratch GPRs with a cycle rotation so the
+ * permutation is safe in place.
